# The Heart of the Matter (Windurst 1-2): Windurst Woods. A level 10 Warrior of Windurst who has completed 1-1 (a GM).
# Section 1: Rakoh Buuma plays its own event; its finish with option 1 begins the mission. Section 2 (1-2 current):
# Miiri-Wohri, Rakoh Buuma, Sola Jaab and Tih Pikeh play 133, 136, 134 and 135. Completed (a GM): Miiri-Wohri, Sola Jaab
# and Tih Pikeh play 118, 117 and 119. Rival zone-in: entering Windurst Woods plays the Seekers of Adventure mission
# Rumors from the West, 839 (another mission's script, not this one); its finish writes that mission's status 4 (area
# 12).
lists WindurstWoods/Rakoh_Buuma/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Miiri-Wohri/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Sola_Jaab/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Tih_Pikeh/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/114
